    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide at midnight</label><div><h5>Overview at midnight</h5><ul><li>Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news. at midnight</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage). at midnight</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts at midnight</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette at midnight</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing) at midnight</li><li>/ : focus search (also via palette) at midnight</li><li>Enter in search: start search at midnight</li><li>ESC: close modals at midnight</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites at midnight</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock at midnight</li></ul><h5>Search & Autocomplete at midnight</h5><ul><li>Bangs:  at midnight!g  at midnight!ddg  at midnight!bing  at midnight!yt  at midnight!wiki  at midnight!maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings;  at midnight{q} as placeholder at midnight</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset) at midnight</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search at midnight</li></ul><h5>Tiles at midnight</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open at midnight</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite at midnight</li><li>Reset: restore default favorites at midnight</li></ul><h5>Widgets & Layout at midnight</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widget at midnight</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal) at midnight</li><li>Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults at midnight</li><li>Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card at midnight</li></ul><h5>Background at midnight</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval) at midnight</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active background at midnight</li></ul><h5>Data at midnight</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON at midnight</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo) at midnight</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
      "agentLabel": "Startpage Agent",
      "agentEnabled": "Agent enabled",
      "agentHint": "If disabled, nothing is sent to Ollama."
    }
